# Voice Control and Dictation (Whisper.rs Integration)

This project includes a voice control and dictation feature powered by the `whisper-rs` crate.

## Core Implementation

The primary logic for voice transcription is encapsulated in the `VoiceController` struct within [src-tauri/src/voice_control.rs](mdc:src-tauri/src/voice_control.rs). This module handles interaction with the `whisper-rs` library, including model loading and audio processing.

Key aspects:
- `VoiceController::new(model_path)`: Initializes the controller with a path to a Whisper model file.
- `VoiceController::transcribe_audio_file(audio_path)`: Transcribes a given WAV audio file.

## Tauri Integration

- **QA Command**: A Tauri command `qa_transcribe_file` has been added to [src-tauri/src/lib.rs](mdc:src-tauri/src/lib.rs) to allow testing of the transcription functionality from the frontend. It takes a model path and an audio file path as input and returns the transcribed text.
- **Dependencies**: The [src-tauri/Cargo.toml](mdc:src-tauri/Cargo.toml) file has been updated to include `whisper-rs` for speech-to-text and `hound` for WAV file processing.

## Future Development
Real-time microphone input and more sophisticated model management are planned future enhancements for this feature.
